Config for **recovery-canary** in **production**:

```json
{
  "build": {
    "builder": "RAILPACK",
    "buildEnvironment": "V3"
  },
  "deploy": {
    "startCommand": "node deployment/canary-launcher.cjs",
    "healthcheckPath": "/health/ready",
    "healthcheckTimeout": 300,
    "restartPolicyType": "NEVER",
    "useLegacyStacker": false,
    "ipv6EgressEnabled": false,
    "runtime": "V2",
    "multiRegionConfig": {
      "sfo": {
        "numReplicas": 1
      }
    }
  }
}
```

Variables defined (13): ADMIN_EMAIL, ADMIN_PASSWORD, CORS_ORIGIN, DATABASE_PATH, EMPIRE_CANARY_ACK, EMPIRE_CANARY_EXPIRES_AT, EMPIRE_CANARY_REDIS_HOST, EMPIRE_ENGINEERING_TEST_MODE, FOUNDER_EMAIL, FOUNDER_PASSWORD, PORT, REDIS_URL, SESSION_SECRET
